# ==============================================================================
# RAMYXEN .gitignore — Security, Memory Dump Protection & Build Hygiene
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRITICAL: Memory Dumps, Forensic Images & Diagnostic Captures (Sensitive PII!)
# Never allow raw RAM images, process dumps, or ETW traces into Git.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.hdmp
*.raw
*.vmem
*.vmsn
*.aff4
*.lime
*.etl
*.etlx
*.gcdump
*.rmp
*.mmp
*.rmxsnap
*.ramyxen-snap
dumps/
captures/
forensics-cases/
snapshots/
traces/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets, Certificates & Local Credentials
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.key
*.pem
*.cer
*.crt
*.secrets.json
secrets.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Development.local.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows / .NET / WinUI 3 / C++ / Rust Build Outputs
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
!docs/release/
!docs/release/**
x64/
x86/
ARM64/
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
Generated Files/
out/
dist/
build/
target/
*.exe
*.dll
*.sys
*.pdb
*.lib
*.exp
*.ilk
*.obj
*.pch
*.idb
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.nupkg
# Local build & release staging (never commit build outputs or release binaries)
artifacts/
artifacts/RAMYXEN-Portable-win-x64.zip
artifacts/RAMYXEN-Setup.exe
artifacts/setup_build/
# Local build & release staging (never commit build outputs or release binaries)
artifacts/
artifacts/remediation-*/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node.js / Tooling / Test Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
TestResults/
coverage/
*.trx
*.lcov
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE, Editor & OS Temporary Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.log
*.swp
tmp/
temp/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
